    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "SOUTHWEST AIRLINES\nA SYMBOL OF FREEDOM®\nOct. 29, 2000 Flight Schedule\nAs a Reservations Sales Agent,\nI find the best flights\nand fares possible to meet\nour Customers' needs.\nHE LOVE FOOTBALL\nGame Schedule Inside!",
      "PaciTic\nSeattle\nSpokane\nPortland\nBoise\nReno/Tahoe\nSacramento\noakland\nSan\nFrancisco\nSan lose\nSalt Lake City\nLas Vegas\nBurbank\nOntario\nLos Angeles orange County\n(Palm Springs Area\nSan Diego\nphoenix\nSUCSON\nMountain\nCentra\nCaster!\nAlbuquerque\nsanta re Area.\nEl Paso\nAmarillo\nLubbock\nMidland/\nDeton\n(Midway\nCleveland\nColumbus\nOmaha\nIndianapolis.\nKansas City\nSt. Louis\nLouisville\nTuisa\nNashville\nOklahoma City\nDallas\n(Love Field)\nLittle Rock\nBirmingham\nacksor\nNew Orleans\nSan Antonio\nCorous\nChrict\nHouston\nIntercontinental)\nSouth Padre Island\n(Harlingen)\nBuffalo\nAlbany\nDoston Arca)\n• Providence (Boston Area\nHartford/Springfield\nLong Island/Islip\nBaltimore/\nWashington\n(BWI)\n(D.C. Area)\nRaleigh-Durham\nJacksonville\n• Orlando\nTampa\nBay\nFt. Lauderdale\n(Miami Area)\nNew nonstop service starts October 29.\n• Daily nonstop service starts October 29.\nNew Saturday nonstop service starts October 29.\nNew nonstop service starts December 10.\n- Daily nonstop service starts December 10.\n©2000 Southwest Airlines Co.\nTo receive a flight schedule, mail requests to:\nSouthwest Airlines Schedule List,\nP.O. Box 650331, Dallas, TX 75265-0331.\nCargo Customers mail requests to:\nCargo Customer Schedule List, HDQ/3CM,\nP.O. Box 36611, Dallas, TX 75235-1611.\nAll other correspondence should be sent to:\nSouthwest Airlines Co.,\nP.O. Box 36611, Dallas, TX 75235-1611.\nSOUTHWEST AIRLINES®\nA SYMBOL OF FREEDOM\nPrinted on recycled paper."
